    "detailed_description": "This is actually the <strong>simplest</strong> game. Everything in this game is simple!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do you want a deeply thought-out plot? --- It's not here! (Or at least <i>it shouldn't be</i>)<br></li><li>Do you want to enjoy heavenly graphics at 4K, 60 FPS? --- What are you talking about? It's a 2D platformer with pixel graphics!<br></li><li>Would you like to hear some epic music? --- The game has a couple of great 8-bit tunes!</li></ul>The developer was so lazy that he made every level the same! <br>But not everything is as simple as it seems at first glance:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each level is a new puzzle!<br></li><li>You have to use 100% of your brain and 200% of your logic!<br></li><li>Every function of the game can help you complete the level!<br></li><li>The game has 3 colorful locations!</li></ul>Try not to break your brain in this plotless(<i>???</i>) adventure!",
